      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sequoia and Echo are the two largest lakes, and they’re the only ones that allow motor boats; the rest are limited to electric or paddle use.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
